      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BECKY BELLE (2) last start finished 4th on July 25 over 300m at this track behind Crossed Toes beaten 7 lengths (18.05) in a Grade 5. Looks hard to beat with even luck. SUPER SKUNK (3) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 6 length 4th at this track (17.75). Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Worth following up. BLAZING BISCUIT (6) was out of the placings last time when eighth at The Gardens (24.21) but scored five back at this track (17.51). Has a good winning strike rate at this journey. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Deserves plenty of respect. LACEY RED (1) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when third (23.32) in a Grade 5 over 400m at The Gardens.",
